{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想提升英語詞彙量並強化口語表達能力？「Learn Vocabulary: Smart Vocab」是一款結合人工智能技術的智能學習工具，專為希望透過互動方式建立字庫、改善發音及日常對話的用戶設計。目前於 App Store 提供限時免費下載，讓用戶能以零成本體驗高品質的語言訓練。</p>\n\n<h2>AI 生成智慧閃卡</h2>\n<p>這款應用利用 Apple Intelligence 自動生成與個人興趣主題相關的智慧閃卡，幫助用戶針對性地學習新詞。內建多種遊戲化練習模式，包括單字搜尋、拼寫挑戰及多選測驗，並設有初階至高級三種學習等級。用戶更可透過語音功能練習真實生活對話句子，即時糾正發音錯誤，在輕鬆互動中鞏固記憶，從而更自信地運用英語進行溝通。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-213-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-214-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-215-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-216-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-217-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-218-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Learn Vocabulary: Smart Vocab</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-10T11:40:28.308631+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":374,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}